SUMMARY:Niagara Falls for Christmas on Ice. Via casino bus
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\nCan you
  believe the holidays are almost here? No better way to celebrate than a t
 rip together to Niagara Falls for their annual [Christmas On Ice celebrati
 on show:](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule
 -of-events/christmas-on-ice.html)\n\nA thrilling high-paced spectacle of w
 orld-class ice skating and holiday cheer\, Fallsview Casino’s Christmas 
 on Ice features a winter wonderland of national championship ice skaters\,
  dancers and singers that will fill you with the magic of the season.\n\n*
 *Make sure you book for 9PM show that night**\n\nWe'll be headed there on 
 comfortable [Safeway Tours bus](https://safewaytours.net/casino). With fre
 e wifi and onboard bathroom.\n\nNOTE - It's up to you to contact Safeway T
 ours and book your spot on the bus. Weekends are busy so highly recommend 
 you make a reservation\n\nnote- you can call Safeway Tours from Nov 20 onw
 ards to book your spot. they only take reservations one week ahead of a tr
 ip\n\n**Cost** - **50 cash.** Must bring **cash** for the [casino bus](%5B
 https://safewaytours.net/casino%5D(https://safewaytours.net/casino)). Once
  you arrive at the casino they will give you 40 in casino credit that you 
 can play with and \, hopefully\, grow even bigger.\n\n[ Everyone else is r
 esponsible for getting their own show ticke](https://www.ticketmaster.ca/f
 allsview-casinos-christmas-on-ice-niagara-falls-ontario-11-27-2026/event/1
 00064EFA0CC8CB1)\n\nAlso bring government ID\, cash\, credit \, debit for 
 whatever you plan to eat\,drink \, gamble\, etc\n\nWhatsApp for this tri\n
 \n[ https://chat.whatsapp.com/FqraC7g3zH94bVl6Q4teZ](https://chat.whatsapp
 .com/FqraC7g3zH94bVl6Q4teZY)\n\nJoin the main[ Whatapps group](https://cha
 t.whatsapp.com/JpUbpvfPcNuFzTJ1VqTLZO) for discussions\, questions\, etc r
 egarding our grou\n\n**Itinerar**y \\- Meet at Broadview/Gerrard to take t
 he **6PM Safeway Tours bu**s to Niagara Falls. Do not be late\, bus won't 
 wait\n\n[ https://safewaytours.net/casino?view=](https://safewaytours.net/
 casino?view=1)\n\n8:30PM - arrive at Niagara Falls then head to the sho\n\
 n9PM - the show start\n\nWhen the show ends we'll have some time to sights
 ee and explore the Falls area before our bus leaves back for Toronto\n\nAf
 ter you have a few options. Take the 12:30AM return bus\nor stay later for
  the 3AM return bus\, provided space is available on it (not guaranteed)\n
 \nOn trip back our bus stops at Bremner /Spadina (by request) \, Spadina/ 
 Dundas\, College/Yonge\, and then final stop is Broadview /Gerrar\n\n**Q -
  Can I drive instead**\n\nA - Sure. We can meet you at casino bus bay when
  we arrive ther\n\n**Q - What should I bring**\n\nA - **Government issued 
 ID. Must be 19+ for the bus**. Weather appropriate clothing\, trip goes ra
 in or shine. $50 cash for casino bus . Stuff for the bus ride (neck pillow
 \, snacks\, charging cable\, battery pack\, headphones\n\n**Q - Can I come
  back on later 3AM bus**\n\nA - Yes but only if they have room. Your guara
 nteed return spot is on the 12:30AM bus\n\n**Q - Can I stay overnight**\n\
 nA - Yes. You are responsible for booking your own hotel and changing your
  return time with Safeway Tours. The next bus back to Toronto on Saturday 
 November 2\n\nConsider joining our[ Whatsap](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59
 mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc?mode=ac_t)p to discuss this and future events to\n\n**
 PLEASE REVIEW RULES**:[ CLICK HERE](https://www.meetup.com/Toronto-Movies-
 and-Outings-Group/pages/6014492/Rules/)\n\n**REMEMBER YOU CAN JUST SHOW UP
  ON THE DAY OF EVENT IF YOU ARE NOT SURE YOU CAN MAKE IT**\n\n**NOTE**: So
 metimes things happen and I might have to cancel so please keep a look out
  for that\n\n**Don't Forget to join our email lis**t (Meetup does not send
  out emails t\neveryone in a group) to get our weekly news later about upc
 oming events:[ http://eepurl.com/hKt76](http://eepurl.com/hKt76f)\n\n*Nico
 las is the organizer for this meetup. If you need to contact him\, please 
 post a message on the wall\, or email him a*t nicolasbello@yahoo.co
